      "html": "<figure class=\"ds-crew\"><div class=\"ds-board\"><span class=\"ds-week\">This week</span><h3>A good week, together.</h3><div class=\"ds-member\"><span class=\"ds-avatar\">A</span><div><strong>Ana</strong><span>Goal reached</span><i></i></div><span>8,240 steps</span></div><p>Park crew</p></div><figcaption>Illustrative squad · Example names and progress</figcaption></figure>",
